# Calibration photos are NOT committed to the repo.
# Only the JSON labels file is versioned; actual JPEGs live on the
# operator's workstation. Place them at the relative_path stated in
# composition_labels.json before running:
#
#     python -m scripts.calibrate_composition_thresholds
#
# This keeps the repo small AND prevents accidental upload of
# personally identifiable photographs.

*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp

# But we DO keep the labels manifest under version control.
!composition_labels.json
!.gitignore
